  "item_short_desc": "<p>Rothco&rsquo;s Vintage Fatigue Cap is a timeless piece inspired by the iconic uniform fatigue cap of the 1960s. Crafted from a lightweight and comfortable 55% cotton / 45% polyester fabric blend, this vintage cap is designed for everyday wear and offers durability and breathability. The distressed wash gives the cap a unique, vintage look and feel, making it a stylish addition to any wardrobe. Perfect for anyone looking to add a classic touch to their outfit, our Vintage Fatigue Cap combines historical charm with modern functionality.</p>",
  "no_ratings": "0",
